# Infra

`KnowledgeBucketStack` is a private S3 bucket plus one managed policy on IAM user `BarUser` (`s3:ListBucket`, `GetObject`, `PutObject`, `DeleteObject`). The user is imported, so attach with `CfnManagedPolicy.users`. `addManagedPolicy()` on an imported user fails.

Do not add RDS, Lambda, OpenSearch, or a VPC. Query and ingest run on the PC against Docker pgvector.

`npm run cdk:synth` from the repo root is fine. Do not run `cdk deploy` or `cdk bootstrap` unless the user explicitly asks. Bucket name is `knowledge-{account}-{region}`; object keys use the `knowledge/` prefix.

```ts
// Bad: new rds.DatabaseInstance(...) or lambda.Function in this stack
// Bad: importedUser.addManagedPolicy(policy)
// Good: (policy.node.defaultChild as iam.CfnManagedPolicy).users = [userName]
```
